# CG-SELECT floor: the current build's one-rectangle CubeGrid selection and its Pull, at the CG-SELECT.scn camera.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 600,800,600
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.3,-0.9,-0.3
Дано run CubeGrid "CubeGrid tool"
Дано run CubeGrid "Aim at the viewport centre: on"
Дано run CubeGrid "Grid Power 5"
Когда run CubeGrid "Select 3x3 blocks at the aim"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 0_rect one 3x3-block selection rectangle on the ground
Когда run CubeGrid "Push/Pull out (E)"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 4_pull a 3x3-block slab one block high with the selection on its top
